37113>>>>>    
37113>>>>>    //
37113>>>>>    // This procedure is called when validating a session and after logging in. Its purpose is to 
37113>>>>>    // update properties based on the session and user data. Augment this function to update 
37113>>>>>    // properties based on the session / user table. Note that WebAppUser and WebAppSession contain
37113>>>>>    // the right records when this procedure is called.
37113>>>>>    //
37113>>>>>    // Params:
37113>>>>>    //      bClear   True if the procedure is called before session validation to clear properties.
37113>>>>>    //
37113>>>>>    Procedure UpdateSessionProperties Boolean bClear
37115>>>>>        Handle hoUserDD
37115>>>>>        
37115>>>>>        Get phoUserDD to hoUserDD
37116>>>>>        
37116>>>>>        //  Update user properties
37116>>>>>        If (not(bClear) and HasRecord(hoUserDD)) Begin
37118>>>>>            Set psUsername to (Trim(WebAppUser.FullName))
37119>>>>>            Set psLoginName to (Trim(WebAppUser.LoginName))
37120>>>>>            Set piUserRights to WebAppUser.Rights
37121>>>>>            
37121>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesSet 
37122>>>>>        End
37122>>>>>>
37122>>>>>        Else Begin
37123>>>>>            Set psUsername to ""
37124>>>>>            Set psLoginName to ""
37125>>>>>            Set piUserRights to 0
37126>>>>>            
37126>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesClear
37127>>>>>        End
37127>>>>>>
37127>>>>>    End_Procedure
37128>>>>>    
37128>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesSet
37130>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37130>>>>>    End_Procedure
37131>>>>>    
37131>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesClear
37133>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37133>>>>>    End_Procedure
37134>>>>>    
37134>>>>>    Procedure EndSession
37136>>>>>        Integer iErr
37136>>>>>        Boolean bLogWebSession
37136>>>>>        Handle hoSessionDD       
37136>>>>>        
37136>>>>>        Get phoSessionDD to hoSessionDD
37137>>>>>        Get pbLogWebSession to bLogWebSession
37138>>>>>        If not bLogWebSession Begin
37140>>>>>            Forward Send EndSession
37142>>>>>            Procedure_Return
37143>>>>>        End
37143>>>>>>
37143>>>>>            
37143>>>>>        //  Check if session exists
37143>>>>>        Send Clear of hoSessionDD
37144>>>>>        Get psSessionKey to WebAppSession.SessionKey
37145>>>>>        
37145>>>>>        Send Find of hoSessionDD EQ Index.1
37146>>>>>        If (Found) Begin
37148>>>>>            Set Field_Changed_Value of hoSessionDD Field WebAppSession.Active to "N"
37149>>>>>            Get Request_Validate of hoSessionDD to iErr
37150>>>>>            If (iErr) Begin
37152>>>>>                // this should not happen. If it does its a programming error
37152>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$WebAppSessionValidateFailed
37153>>>>>>
37153>>>>>                Procedure_Return
37154>>>>>            End
37154>>>>>>
37154>>>>>            Send Request_Save of hoSessionDD
37155>>>>>        End
37155>>>>>>
37155>>>>>    End_Procedure
